          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>
              Modern 28mm plastic miniatures from manufacturers like Warlord Games are closer to 30-32mm in practice. 
              A true 1:56 tank looks small next to them. 1:48 Tamiya kits match the heroic proportions better 
              and are often cheaper than official wargaming vehicles. Use our 
              <a href="/reference/1-48-to-28mm" class="text-[#ff6b35] hover:text-white transition-colors font-semibold">1:48 to 28mm guide</a> 
