          <span class="faq-question pr-4" itemprop="name">What does "Eye Level" vs "Top of Head" mean in miniature scale?</span>
          <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down text-[#ff6b35] text-xs transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 shrink-0"></i>
