          <div itemprop="text">
            <p>
              Eye Level measures from feet to eyes (160cm on a 175cm human). Top of Head measures to the crown. 
              The 15cm difference creates a <span class="text-white font-semibold">5-10% variance</span> in scale calculations. 
              Fantasy miniatures typically use eye level to account for helmets and hats. Historical kits often use top of head. 
              Our matrix includes both values where applicable.
